WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:02.610
Good old-fashioned goats,

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:05.400
and the ancient Hindu practice of yoga.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.050
Two things that don't seem to go together.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:10.160
You got peanut butter in my chocolate!

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:14.580
But one year ago a small farm in Oregon invented
goat yoga.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:19.300
And the unlikely trend spread across the nation
until it reached the east coast,

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.460
when the unstoppable force of goat yoga

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:25.560
met the immovable object of the Washington
DC Deparment of Health.

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:40.640
Goat yoga is literally we do yoga as a class,
40 minutes,

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.500
and we just have the goats hang out with us.

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:46.579
So we would go through the different asanas
and the different flows

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:51.360
and the goats will come around and interact
with people as we're doing the class.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.820
So they may walk up to somebody and sniff
their nose, maybe nibble on some toes,

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:57.950
and if they're feeling brave enough or want
to they might jump on them

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:01.800
or give them a kiss or something.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:05.100
DC is not very livestock oriented.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.600
I know it was a big thing with the Health
Department though,

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:11.120
they asked us to do a lot of things with our
vet certifications,

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:13.620
health certificates and things like that

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:15.060
and we did everything they asked

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:17.560
and they ended up squashing it anyway.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:25.260
Congressional Cemetery is a historic cemetery
founded in 1807.

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:31.460
It is a private cemetery, home to about 160
markers for individual congressmen.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:36.440
We opened up our chapel every Wednesday night
to a yoga instructor.

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:37.799
We call it Yoga Mortis.

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:42.620
There are some who find their inner peace
next to dead people.

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:44.360
Corpse pose.

00:01:44.369 --> 00:01:49.420
We've had goats to eat all of our invasive
species in our forested area of the cemetery.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:53.000
So we thought, why not combine baby goats
and yoga.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.940
We knew we would need a permit for that because
we're bringing in livestock into the district.

00:01:56.940 --> 00:02:00.400
And so we went to the Department of Health
to obtain that permit.

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.920
And when I went down to meet with them it
was in a conference room

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:05.480
the director was there which kind of surprised
me.

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:08.040
and about four lawyers were there

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:10.880
with all of the rules and regulations open on their laptops

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:14.220
ready to kind of throw every curve ball they
possibly could at me

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:15.700
to prevent goat yoga.

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:27.600
Goats have been domesticated for about 6000
years,

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:32.320
but they required that we obtain a wildlife
handler's certificate

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:33.940
for our goat farmer.

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:39.980
They initially were worried that someone would
fall during a yoga class or an exercise

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:43.580
and hurt a baby goat, which is really difficult
to do,

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:47.300
if you've ever been around a herd of goats,
especially babies,

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:51.129
they are constantly falling down, jumping
on each other, jumping on rocks,

00:02:51.129 --> 00:02:52.420
really having the time of their life.

00:02:57.180 --> 00:03:00.720
But what if the goats are not having the time
of their lives?

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:04.440
What if the department of health was right
when it told Washingtonian Magazine:

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:08.420
"Any time animals come into the District,
we want to make sure they are safe

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:10.880
and not being put into a position of harm."

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:16.480
Expressing "concern for the safety of the
animals should someone ever fall over one."

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:20.360
and deeming goat yoga "a violation of a 'no
touch' policy

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:24.120
by spectators for animals participating in
District events."

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:30.010
Mount Vernon Square neighborhood had a petting
zoo four youngsters

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:34.170
and they had far more exotic animals than
goats, they even had a llama,

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:37.460
which is a pretty vile animal if you've ever
been around a spitting llama.

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:42.560
But they allowed a lot of this 'no touching'
to actually happen at that petting zoo.

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:47.100
There's no reason that you can't do goat yoga.

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:51.120
Great, what's next, uh, llama yoga?

